734
00:35:16.281 --> 00:35:18.149
and they still landed sharp.

735
00:35:19.651 --> 00:35:21.119
I thought, "Yeah, I've got this."

736
00:35:24.656 --> 00:35:26.024
- [contestant] He's good.
- [contestant 2] He is.

737
00:35:26.891 --> 00:35:27.926
He knows when to wait.

738
00:35:29.561 --> 00:35:30.695
Great guard control.

739
00:35:32.464 --> 00:35:33.632
[contestants cheer]

740
00:35:34.332 --> 00:35:37.102
Wow. That's how you do it.

741
00:35:40.438 --> 00:35:42.073
- That one landed solid.
- Great.

742
00:35:43.975 --> 00:35:45.910
See how he reads his moves and counters?

743
00:35:48.346 --> 00:35:49.547
[contestant 3] Now this is worth watching.

744
00:35:50.348 --> 00:35:51.883
This is real boxing.

745
00:35:52.517 --> 00:35:53.551
This is pro boxing.

746
00:35:56.855 --> 00:35:58.490
[contestant 4] Wow. Nice one.

747
00:36:00.425 --> 00:36:02.460
[contestant 5] But that MMA guy's
no slouch either.

748
00:36:02.527 --> 00:36:04.996
