751
00:36:08.299 --> 00:36:09.501
[contestant 5] Right, he's a striker.

752
00:36:10.335 --> 00:36:12.404
[contestant 6] That MMA guy's super good, though.

753
00:36:14.973 --> 00:36:16.207
[contestant 5] Kim Minwoo's sharp.

754
00:36:18.743 --> 00:36:19.778
His timing is good.

755
00:36:24.816 --> 00:36:25.817
That was great.

756
00:36:26.351 --> 00:36:27.385
Whoa, amazing.

757
00:36:28.987 --> 00:36:30.255
They're going back and forth.

758
00:36:30.321 --> 00:36:31.656
They're both good.

759
00:36:32.290 --> 00:36:34.726
- They're both trading. Yeah.
- They're both good.

760
00:36:36.528 --> 00:36:38.229
Very nice. They're both good.

761
00:36:41.800 --> 00:36:43.868
He's countering pretty well.

762
00:36:43.935 --> 00:36:46.404
[contestant 7] That MMA guy's
got serious boxing skills.

763
00:36:54.079 --> 00:36:55.080
[bell dinging]

764
00:36:56.081 --> 00:36:57.082
Stop!

765
00:36:58.016 --> 00:36:59.684
[announcer] <i>The fight is over.</i>

766
00:36:59.751 --> 00:37:01.619
[contestant] The red corner guy's good.

767
00:37:01.686 --> 00:37:03.688
- [contestant 2] For an MMA fighter.
- [contestant 3] Yeah, he's good.

768
00:37:03.755 --> 00:37:06.157
- Who's your bet?
- Blue corner, of course.

769
00:37:06.224 --> 00:37:07.392
He'll win for sure.

770
00:37:08.126 --> 00:37:11.362
[announcer] <i>Master,
please announce the survivor.</i>

771
00:37:11.429 --> 00:37:12.564
[contestant] Oh, boy...

772
00:37:13.498 --> 00:37:15.767
- Hold on, give me a moment.
- [Dex chuckles]

773
00:37:15.834 --> 00:37:17.202
This one's pretty tough.

774
00:37:17.769 --> 00:37:19.437
[contestant] Red corner might've taken it.

775
00:37:20.538 --> 00:37:22.440
[contestant 2] Blue corner's won,
don't you think?

776
00:37:23.174 --> 00:37:26.044
His punches were heavier,
but he threw more attacks overall.

777
00:37:26.611 --> 00:37:27.612
[contestant 3] They both did well.

778
00:37:28.880 --> 00:37:32.250
For the first time today,
Don Lee kept saying

779
00:37:32.317 --> 00:37:34.719
that they're good.

780
00:37:34.786 --> 00:37:36.521
That's how great the fight was.

781
00:37:36.588 --> 00:37:37.722
- Well done.
- Thank you.

782
00:37:37.789 --> 00:37:39.491
[contestants applaud]

783
00:37:39.557 --> 00:37:41.559
The survivor of this match is...

784
