I wouldn't be surprised.

788
00:37:57.776 --> 00:37:59.778
Lee Juyeong from the blue corner.

789
00:38:00.645 --> 00:38:01.746
{\an8}LEE JUYEONG SURVIVES

790
00:38:01.813 --> 00:38:02.981
{\an8}Thank you, sir!

791
00:38:03.047 --> 00:38:04.749
{\an8}[contestants applaud]

792
00:38:04.816 --> 00:38:06.151
[Lee] Wait, hold on.

793
00:38:06.217 --> 00:38:07.819
Wait, hold on.

794
00:38:07.886 --> 00:38:09.454
Wait, I'm not done.

795
00:38:11.856 --> 00:38:15.460
Kim Minwoo from the red corner
also survives.

796
00:38:15.527 --> 00:38:16.528
{\an8}[contestants gasp]

797
00:38:16.594 --> 00:38:18.296
{\an8}RED CORNER KIM MINWOO SURVIVES

798
00:38:18.363 --> 00:38:20.498
{\an8}- Thank you, sir!
- Was that like the Golden Buzzer?

799
00:38:20.565 --> 00:38:22.700
- He can do that?
- Yeah, fair enough.

800
00:38:22.767 --> 00:38:25.770
[Lee] It was neck and neck
between you two.

801
00:38:25.837 --> 00:38:27.772
I want to see you both again,

802
00:38:28.773 --> 00:38:31.943
so I decided to advance you both.
I'm not sure if that's okay, though.

803
00:38:32.010 --> 00:38:33.978
- Is that allowed?
- I don't know.

804
00:38:34.045 --> 00:38:35.280
I'm not sure.

805
00:38:35.914 --> 00:38:38.550
Actually, you can't see them from here,

806
00:38:38.616 --> 00:38:42.320
but there are professional judges
watching this with us.

807
00:38:42.387 --> 00:38:45.557
The final result
includes their evaluations as well.

808
00:38:45.623 --> 00:38:48.560
So I hope the rest of you
continue to bring that same energy.

809
00:38:48.626 --> 00:38:49.761
Great work.

810
00:38:49.828 --> 00:38:51.262
- Thank you, sir!
- Appreciate it!

811
00:38:52.230 --> 00:38:53.998
I think they both deserved it too.

812
00:38:54.532 --> 00:38:56.134
- They were both so good.
- [Jongkook] Yeah.

813
00:38:56.768 --> 00:38:59.337
[Lee] My next pick is

814
00:38:59.404 --> 00:39:01.406
Ring No. 4.

815
00:39:01.472 --> 00:39:03.208
Ring No. 4.

816
