823
00:39:18.523 --> 00:39:20.191
[Jongkook] This looks like a tough match.

824
00:39:21.192 --> 00:39:25.663
- As for YunB, he's trained for years.
- Oh, I see.

825
00:39:26.297 --> 00:39:30.969
Hey, everyone. I'm a rapper
and the best fighter among Korean rappers.

826
00:39:31.035 --> 00:39:32.036
The name's YunB.

827
00:39:32.937 --> 00:39:36.241
Having experienced both music
and combat, I know how to fight.

828
00:39:36.908 --> 00:39:40.912
As the guy known as
the best fighter among Korean rappers,

829
00:39:40.979 --> 00:39:41.980
I'm confident.

830
00:39:45.717 --> 00:39:47.518
If my punch lands,

831
00:39:47.585 --> 00:39:48.720
