832
00:39:48.786 --> 00:39:51.890
World champions?
Believe me, this could knock them out.

833
00:39:53.892 --> 00:39:55.660
That's him acting it up for the show.

834
00:39:56.361 --> 00:39:58.429
I'll show him the difference

835
00:39:59.130 --> 00:40:00.465
