836
00:40:02.600 --> 00:40:04.168
I'll prove it with the results.

837
00:40:05.403 --> 00:40:08.273
{\an8}YUNB VERSUS YUK JUNSEO

838
00:40:08.840 --> 00:40:10.174
Junseo's punches...

839
00:40:10.842 --> 00:40:13.645
- They're insanely strong for his size.
- Really?

840
00:40:14.746 --> 00:40:18.049
[contestant] I hear
YunB has a fiery personality.

841
00:40:18.116 --> 00:40:20.518
I think he'll throw quick jabs,
like pow, pow, pow.

842
00:40:20.585 --> 00:40:23.421
- Let's begin right away. Box!
- [bell dings]

843
00:40:23.488 --> 00:40:26.257
[contestants] Let's go! You got this!

844
00:40:29.093 --> 00:40:30.094
[contestant] He's fast.

845
00:40:31.129 --> 00:40:32.563
[contestants gasp]

846
00:40:36.567 --> 00:40:37.869
[contestant] Oh, Yuk Junseo's good.

847
