851
00:40:53.418 --> 00:40:55.687
Junseo needs to tuck his chin in.

852
00:40:55.753 --> 00:40:57.555
- He might...
- If one of those lands...

853
00:40:57.622 --> 00:40:58.756
He'd better watch out.

854
00:41:04.729 --> 00:41:06.130
[contestant] He's got
great distance control.

855
00:41:07.899 --> 00:41:09.067
[contestant 2] His jabs hit hard.

856
00:41:11.102 --> 00:41:12.370
[contestants gasping]

857
00:41:14.205 --> 00:41:15.206
[contestant] He's good.

858
00:41:15.807 --> 00:41:16.808
Whoa.

859
00:41:20.611 --> 00:41:21.779
Oh, nice jab!

860
00:41:21.846 --> 00:41:23.648
- Nice!
- He's good!

861
00:41:35.293 --> 00:41:36.694
- [contestant 2] Nice.
- [contestants gasp] Whoa!

862
00:41:36.761 --> 00:41:38.129
Stop! Time!

863
00:41:44.402 --> 00:41:47.071
- [contestant 3] That was clean.
- [contestant 4] That landed beautifully.

864
00:41:47.138 --> 00:41:48.606
[referee] Stop! Time!

865
00:41:50.308 --> 00:41:51.576
[contestant 5] That was amazing.

866
00:41:58.049 --> 00:41:59.450
{\an8}RED CORNER YUNB IS DOWN

867
00:41:59.517 --> 00:42:00.985
{\an8}[contestant 6] That's a clean knockdown.

868
00:42:01.052 --> 00:42:03.755
- Two, three...
- [contestant 7] That was a solid hit.

869
00:42:03.821 --> 00:42:06.824
- ...four, five, six...
- He's gonna lose his best fighter title.

870
00:42:06.891 --> 00:42:09.660
- Wow, Junseo's on another level.
- ...seven, eight.

871
00:42:09.727 --> 00:42:11.229
- [referee] Look at me. You okay?
- Okay.

872
00:42:11.295 --> 00:42:13.031
- Yes, sir.
- All right, come on.

873
00:42:13.097 --> 00:42:14.832
- You think you can keep going?
- Yes.

874
00:42:14.899 --> 00:42:16.501
- He wants to keep going.
- Really?

875
00:42:17.335 --> 00:42:18.336
That's cool.

876
00:42:18.403 --> 00:42:20.671
- Let's go!
- You got this, man!

877
00:42:20.738 --> 00:42:23.408
[contestant] He wants to push
