- Totally.

887
00:42:50.635 --> 00:42:53.438
He's way better than I thought.

888
00:42:54.005 --> 00:42:55.440
- I'm surprised.
- Same here.

889
00:42:55.973 --> 00:42:59.110
YunB, that was impressive,
fighting till the end.

890
