That was our second KO on <i>I Am Boxer.</i>

891
00:43:06.117 --> 00:43:10.354
My punches hit harder
than you'd expect for my weight class.

892
00:43:10.855 --> 00:43:12.390
I knew that was my strength,

893
00:43:13.191 --> 00:43:15.126
