903
00:43:40.751 --> 00:43:42.253
Ring No. 2.

904
00:43:43.254 --> 00:43:44.722
He's just built differently.

905
00:43:44.789 --> 00:43:46.390
Man, that build. It's insane.

906
00:43:46.457 --> 00:43:48.726
Do we finally get to see this?

907
00:43:48.793 --> 00:43:50.261
- Julien Kang, you mean?
- Julien Kang?

908
00:43:50.795 --> 00:43:52.296
[contestants cheering]

909
00:43:53.531 --> 00:43:55.133
- This is gonna be a big match.
- Yeah.

910
00:43:55.199 --> 00:43:56.200
[announcer] <i>Ring No. 2.</i>

911
00:43:56.267 --> 00:43:59.003
<i>From the red corner,
the toughest fighter in entertainment.</i>

912
00:43:59.070 --> 00:44:00.204
<i>Julien Kang!</i>

913
00:44:01.973 --> 00:44:03.841
[contestant] His arms seem longer
