- [Jongkook] I know.

916
00:44:07.645 --> 00:44:09.347
It's basically the length of a spear.

917
00:44:09.914 --> 00:44:12.884
He's in a different league.

918
00:44:12.950 --> 00:44:15.186
- He's got long limbs.
- Good-looking guy.

919
00:44:15.820 --> 00:44:18.189
Hello, I'm Julien Kang.

920
00:44:18.256 --> 00:44:19.257
TOP CELEB FIGHTER

921
00:44:19.323 --> 00:44:21.492
Compared to other entertainers,

922
00:44:21.559 --> 00:44:24.061
I've got a bigger frame

923
00:44:24.128 --> 00:44:27.999
and more martial arts training experience,

924
00:44:28.065 --> 00:44:31.435
so I might be a top contender here.

925
00:44:31.502 --> 00:44:36.007
My reach is long for my height too.

926
00:44:36.073 --> 00:44:39.710
So that gives me a bit of an edge.

927
00:44:40.278 --> 00:44:43.414
I really love boxing.

928
00:44:43.481 --> 00:44:45.850
I want to show that I'm a fearless boxer,

929
00:44:45.917 --> 00:44:48.886
one who never gives up.

930
00:44:49.820 --> 00:44:53.824
[Jongkook] Song Hyunmin weighs 130 kg, though.

931
00:44:53.891 --> 00:44:54.992
{\an8}Right, that's rare.

932
00:44:55.059 --> 00:44:56.093
{\an8}SONG HYUNMIN

933
00:44:56.160 --> 00:44:57.795
Gosh, he's tall too!

934
00:44:57.862 --> 00:44:59.797
- They're heavyweights.
- This will be fun.

935
00:44:59.864 --> 00:45:02.567
- [contestant] Finally, it's Julien Kang.
- [contestant 2] We might see another KO.

936
00:45:02.633 --> 00:45:05.002
- But you never know.
- Right.

937
00:45:05.503 --> 00:45:07.705
[contestants] Let's go! You got this!

938
00:45:07.772 --> 00:45:09.674
Let's go! Come on!

939
00:45:09.740 --> 00:45:11.909
Ring No. 2, box!

940
00:45:11.976 --> 00:45:13.344
[bell dings]

941
00:45:13.411 --> 00:45:15.012
- Box!
- [contestant] Let's do this!

942
00:45:15.613 --> 00:45:17.248
[Lee] Man, that reach!

943
00:45:19.417 --> 00:45:20.618
Look at that reach.

944
00:45:20.685 --> 00:45:22.453
A few hits like that could put you out.

945
00:45:23.721 --> 00:45:25.556
[contestants] Let's go! You got this!

946
00:45:27.024 --> 00:45:28.292
That's it.

947
00:45:28.359 --> 00:45:29.527
[metal clangs]

948
